💡 Insights
📌 Most Informative Features (Top k by MIR): Sleep quality, social interactions, anxiety level, employment status, etc.

🔄 Overlap Found: Many features indicative of depression are also predictive of demographic labels, raising important fairness concerns.

⚠️ Worst Performance: Models performed worst for African American Females, suggesting potential model bias or under-representation in data.

🧠 Deep learning (MLP) underperformed compared to Random Forest in almost all groups, especially under smaller k values.

⚙️ Increasing k improved performance slightly but also risked overfitting.

